"Output\",\"value\":\"Transparent PNG · White · Custom scene\"},{\"label\":\"Images\",\"value\":\"1\"}],\"presetInputs\":[{\"id\":\"backgroundMode\",\"label\":\"Background\",\"description\":\"What the subject should sit on after removal. Transparent = a real cutout on true alpha; White background = a clean white studio backdrop; Custom = a new scene you describe below. Defaults to Transparent.\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Transparent\",\"value\":\"transparent\",\"prompt\":\"Transparent — return the subject on a genuine transparent alpha channel (a real PNG with true transparency). No background at all: no white or gray fill, no painted checkerboard, and no added canvas, padding, outline, or drop shadow.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/background_removal/bg-transparent.jpg?v=1\"},{\"label\":\"White background\",\"value\":\"white\",\"prompt\":\"White background — place the cut-out subject on a clean, uniform pure-white (#FFFFFF) studio background: evenly lit, no gradient, texture, vignette, or props. A subtle natural contact shadow directly under the subject is acceptable. Return an opaque image.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/background_removal/bg-white.jpg?v=1\"},{\"label\":\"Custom\",\"value\":\"custom\",\"prompt\":\"Custom background — remove the original background and place the subject, unchanged, onto the new background described under 'New background'. Recreate that scene photorealistically behind the subject and integrate it naturally — match perspective, scale, lighting direction, and color temperature, and add a grounded contact shadow or reflection as the scene calls for — while keeping the subject itself pixel-faithful.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/background_removal/bg-custom.jpg?v=1\"}]}],\"imageInputs\":[{\"id\":\"sourceImage\",\"label\":\"Image to cut out\",\"description\":\"The photo whose main subject should be isolated.\",\"required\":true,\"minImages\":1,\"maxImages\":1}],\"textInputs\":[{\"id\":\"customBackground\",\"label\":\"New background\",\"description\":\"Only for Custom: describe the scene the subject should be placed on (e.g. 'a rainy neon-lit city street at night' or 'a white marble kitchen counter in soft window light').\",\"required\":false,\"multiline\":true,\"placeholder\":\"Describe the new background scene (Custom mode only)\"},{\"id\":\"notes\",\"label\":\"Notes (optional)\",\"required\":false,\"placeholder\":\"Optional: anything specific you want\"}],\"inputOrder\":[\"backgroundMode\",\"sourceImage\",\"customBackground\",\"notes\"],\"promptTemplate\":\"$71\",\"variants\":[]},{\"id\":\"imagine-ecommerce-listing\",\"title\":\"E-Commerce Photos\",\"description\":\"Turn one product photo into a complete 6-image e-commerce listing set — main on white, benefit infographic, lifestyle, in-use, detail close-up, and true-scale in-hand shot.\",\"category\":\"Marketing\",\"coverImageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ecommerce_photos/ecommerce_photos_cover.jpg?v=3\",\"coverVerticalImageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ecommerce_photos/ecommerce_photos_vertical.jpg?v=2\",\"settings\":[{\"label\":\"Aspect\",\"value\":\"1:1\"},{\"label\":\"Output\",\"value\":\"6 images\"}],\"imageInputs\":[{\"id\":\"productPhoto\",\"label\":\"Product photo\",\"description\":\"One clear, well-lit photo of your product — if it has a label, make sure it is readable.\",\"required\":true,\"minImages\":1,\"maxImages\":1}],\"textInputs\":[{\"id\":\"benefit1\",\"label\":\"Product benefit 1\",\"description\":\"Short benefit phrases (2–3). These are the ONLY claims that will appear on the images.\",\"required\":true,\"placeholder\":\"e.g., No guilt snack\"},{\"id\":\"benefit2\",\"label\":\"Product benefit 2\",\"required\":true,\"placeholder\":\"e.g., Extra crunchy\"},{\"id\":\"benefit3\",\"label\":\"Product benefit 3 (optional)\",\"required\":false,\"placeholder\":\"e.g., Sea salt finish\"},{\"id\":\"sizeHint\",\"label\":\"Size hint (optional)\",\"required\":false,\"placeholder\":\"e.g., \\\"about 7 in tall\\\" or \\\"fits in one hand\\\"\"}],\"promptTemplate\":\"$72\",\"inputOrder\":[\"productPhoto\",\"benefit1\",\"benefit2\",\"benefit3\",\"sizeHint\"],\"variants\":[]},{\"id\":\"imagine-collage\",\"title\":\"Photo Collage\",\"description\":\"Combine 2-16 of your photos into tasteful, shareable collages — pick one or more styles (one collage per style): pure grid, torn paper, bento cards, travel journal, or photo-booth strip.\",\"category\":\"Photo Tools\",\"settings\":[{\"label\":\"Mode\",\"value\":\"Image\"},{\"label\":\"Images\",\"value\":\"2-16\"},{\"label\":\"Orientation\",\"value\":\"Landscape / Portrait\"}],\"presetInputs\":[{\"id\":\"style\",\"label\":\"Styles\",\"description\":\"Pick one or more styles — you get one collage per selected style.\",\"required\":true,\"multiSelect\":true,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Pure grid\",\"value\":\"pure-grid\",\"prompt\":\"a clean photo grid that ALWAYS fills the entire canvas, using exactly this partition for the photo count: 2 photos = two full-height side-by-side columns; 3 = one large cell filling the left two-thirds plus the other two photos stacked on the right third; 4 = a 2x2 grid; 5 = a top row of two cells over a bottom row of three; 6 = a 3x2 grid; more photos = the most balanced near-square grid. Cover-crop every photo INTO its cell so the cell is completely filled edge to edge — a photo never floats inside a cell; straight uniform white gutters (about 2% of the canvas) with the same slim outer border; zero slack canvas — no white area larger than a gutter anywhere; keep every photo's original colors exactly (no black-and-white conversion, no regrading); no frames, no tilting, no overlapping, no decoration — the grid IS the image\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/collage/style_pure_grid.jpg?v=4\"},{\"label\":\"Torn paper\",\"value\":\"torn-paper\",\"prompt\":\"each photo torn along irregular white ripped-paper edges, the torn pieces layered and overlapping on a warm kraft-beige paper backdrop with soft drop shadows — handmade, tactile, imperfect by design\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/collage/style_torn_paper.jpg?v=7\"},{\"label\":\"Bento cards\",\"value\":\"bento-cards\",\"prompt\":\"the photos in rounded-corner cards of deliberately varied sizes packed into a neat bento grid with even padding on a soft off-white background, subtle card shadows — modern app aesthetic, clean and friendly\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/collage/style_bento.jpg?v=6\"},{\"label\":\"Travel journal\",\"value\":\"travel-journal\",\"prompt\":\"an open travel-journal spread: the photos taped over a faint vintage map, a dotted route line wandering between them, a compass stamp and ticket-stub ephemera in the corners — short generic handwritten-style captions are part of this style and allowed\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/collage/style_travel_journal.jpg?v=7\"},{\"label\":\"Photo-booth strip\",\"value\":\"photo-booth-strip\",\"prompt\":\"one pristine vertical photo-booth strip filling the canvas height, shot perfectly straight and flat-on (no tilt, no perspective): exactly one equal frame per photo stacked inside the strip with even white borders, and EVERY frame completely filled by its photo — cover-crop each photo into its frame edge to edge, a photo never floats small inside a frame; crisp print quality, plain warm off-white background, barely-there soft shadow — iconic, symmetrical, clean\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/collage/style_booth_strip.jpg?v=8\"}]}],\"aspectInputs\":[{\"id\":\"orientation\",\"label\":\"Orientation\",\"description\":\"Landscape or portrait — the whole collage is composed to fill that canvas shape.\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"2:3\",\"name\":\"Portrait\",\"prompt\":\"a PORTRAIT canvas with a 2:3 vertical aspect ratio (clearly taller than wide) — lay the whole collage out to FILL this tall canvas edge to edge, adapting the cell arrangement, proportions and gutters to the vertical format (favor taller stacks); never letterbox, pad or leave the canvas partly empty\"},{\"value\":\"3:2\",\"name\":\"Landscape\",\"prompt\":\"a LANDSCAPE canvas with a 3:2 horizontal aspect ratio (clearly wider than tall) — lay the whole collage out to FILL this wide canvas edge to edge, adapting the cell arrangement, proportions and gutters to the horizontal format (favor wider rows); never letterbox, pad or leave the canvas partly empty\"}]}],\"textInputs\":[{\"id\":\"notes\",\"label\":\"Notes (optional)\",\"required\":false,\"placeholder\":\"Optional: anything specific you want\"}],\"imageInputs\":[{\"id\":\"photos\",\"label\":\"Your photos\",\"description\":\"2 to 16 photos to combine — every photo you attach will appear in the collage exactly once.\",\"required\":true,\"minImages\":2,\"maxImages\":16}],\"inputOrder\":[\"photos\",\"style\",\"orientation\"],\"promptTemplate\":\"$73\",\"coverImageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/collage/collage_cover.jpg?v=10\",\"coverVerticalImageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/collage/collage_vertical.jpg?v=10\",\"variants\":[{\"inputs\":null,\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/collage/variants/designer-bento-2x3.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":null,\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/collage/variants/designer-travel-journal-2x3.jpg?v=20260723\"},{\"inputs\":null,\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/collage/variants/designer-pure-grid-2x3.jpg?v=20260723\"},{\"inputs\":null,\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/collage/variants/designer-photo-booth-2x3.jpg\"}]},{\"id\":\"imagine-profile-picture\",\"title\":\"Profile Picture\",\"description\":\"Turn a casual photo into a standout social or dating profile picture — authentic-looking, like a 